# Captured world data and everything derived from it. Captures are large, machine-local, and
# re-creatable with /copier; each developer captures their own. Scenarios name coordinates in a
# particular captured world and baselines record numbers measured against it, so neither means
# anything on a machine that does not have the capture — they stay local with it. A shared team
# would put capture, scenarios and baselines together on shared storage, as one unit.
# See designs/stonebrick.md §3.
